{"title":"F&B Associate Roadmap","role":"F&B Associate","summary":"B.Sc. Hospitality Science → F&B Intern → F&B Associate → Senior F&B Associate → Captain/Supervisor → F&B Executive/Assistant Manager → F&B Manager → Director of F&B → Hotel/Restaurant Operations Leadership","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. Hospitality Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Hospitality Science → F&B Intern → F&B Associate → Senior F&B Associate → Captain/Supervisor → F&B Executive/Assistant Manager → F&B Manager → Director of F&B → Hotel/Restaurant Operations Leadership"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential sectors:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotels and resorts"},{"text":"Restaurants and cafés"},{"text":"Fine dining"},{"text":"Quick-service restaurants"},{"text":"Catering companies"},{"text":"Banquet and convention operations"},{"text":"Cruise hospitality"},{"text":"Airlines and airport hospitality"},{"text":"Clubs and recreational facilities"},{"text":"Corporate/institutional food services"},{"text":"Food-service startups"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Core Learning","Practical Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Hospitality fundamentals, food production, food & beverage service, housekeeping, front office"},{"text":"Table setup, service etiquette, menu knowledge, guest interaction"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Restaurant operations, beverage management, nutrition, food safety, hospitality accounting"},{"text":"POS, order management, billing, service sequence, hygiene"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"F&B management, purchasing, inventory, cost control, event/banquet operations"},{"text":"Stock control, costing, scheduling, vendor coordination"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Hospitality management, revenue management, leadership, entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Team supervision, restaurant audits, menu enginee